{"seq":8,"slug":"database-systems","title":"数据库系统","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据库系统-简介\">数据库系统 简介</h1><p>数据库系统是现代软件架构的基石。从用户注册信息到交易记录，从社交动态到物联网传感器数据，几乎所有应用程序都依赖数据库来持久化存储、高效检索和安全管理数据。理解数据库的核心原理和实践方法，是每一位软件工程师不可或缺的基本功。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望深入理解数据库系统原理和实战技巧的开发者。无论你是刚接触数据库的初学者，还是在生产环境中处理复杂查询和性能瓶颈的资深工程师，这里都将为你提供从理论到实践的完整知识体系。</p>\n<p>知识库将系统性地覆盖以下领域：关系型数据库基础，包括数据模型、SQL 语言和范式理论；数据库引擎内部原理，深入存储引擎、索引结构、查询优化器和事务管理机制；NoSQL 数据库生态，涵盖键值存储、文档数据库、列族存储和图数据库；数据库设计与建模方法论，教你如何设计高效合理的数据架构；性能调优实战，从慢查询分析到索引策略优化；以及分布式数据库与数据一致性，探讨在大规模系统中的数据管理挑战与解决方案。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"relational-model","title":"关系模型基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"relational-algebra","title":"关系代数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/relational-algebra"},{"seq":2,"slug":"normalization","title":"范式与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/normalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"er-modeling","title":"ER 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/er-modeling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-integrity","title":"数据完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/data-integrity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sql-mastery","title":"SQL 精通","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddl-and-dml","title":"DDL 与 DML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/ddl-and-dml"},{"seq":2,"slug":"complex-queries","title":"复杂查询与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/complex-queries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"aggregate-window-functions","title":"聚合窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/aggregate-window-functions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"stored-procedures","title":"存储过程与函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/stored-procedures"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"indexing-and-storage","title":"索引与存储引擎","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"b-tree-indexes","title":"B 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/b-tree-indexes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-and-bitmap","title":"哈希与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/hash-and-bitmap"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-engines","title":"存储引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/storage-engines"},{"seq":4,"slug":"partitioning","title":"分区与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/partitioning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"transactions-and-concurrency","title":"事务与并发控制","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"acid-properties","title":"ACID 特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/acid-properties"},{"seq":2,"slug":"isolation-levels","title":"隔离级别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/isolation-levels"},{"seq":3,"slug":"locking-mechanisms","title":"锁机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/locking-mechanisms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"distributed-transactions","title":"分布式事务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/distributed-transactions"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"nosql-and-newdb","title":"NoSQL 与新型数据库","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-an